Package: MsBackendLite
Title: Read-only SQLite Backend for Spectra
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Chong", family = "Tang",
           email = "chong.tang.mat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A read-only backend for the Spectra package that stores mass
    spectrometry data in a single SQLite file. m/z and intensity values are
    stored as plain numeric columns, one row per peak, and peaks are read in
    chunks sized by number of peaks, so data larger than memory can be
    analysed on an ordinary computer. Nothing a user does to a Spectra object
    changes the database; every filter can be undone.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    Spectra (>= 1.23.7)
